'''Samir Zárate''' (21 May 1845 – 3 August 1923) was the fifth [[President of the Baliscan Confederation|President of Balisca]], presiding from 1883 until 1893. He was the first President to be appointed after the adoption of the [[1883 Confederal Convention|1883 Baliscan Constitution]]. 

